<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Start With a Coat Closet Zone Map</h2>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Every part of a coat closet can do one job. When each zone has a clear purpose, it&#8217;s obvious where things go back, even for kids and guests.</p>



